{"unit_id":"TSE2006__dsh-spend-meter#feature-1","repo":"TSE2006/dsh-spend-meter","commit":"1f48279facf4f387782b6d4416fe7a657eec8ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Spend Meter** 的功能「对话花费账本」：按会话事件核算输入、输出、缓存、搜索和自动压缩成本，并按峰谷价目合计。重试会替换旧样本。通过 composer dock 药丸打开账本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:370","client.js:1461"]}
{"unit_id":"TSE2006__dsh-spend-meter#feature-2","repo":"TSE2006/dsh-spend-meter","commit":"1f48279facf4f387782b6d4416fe7a657eec8ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Spend Meter** 的功能「账户余额」：在 composer dock 显示 DeepSeek 账户余额，并在面板展示状态。Host 定期读取账户服务并更新投影。点击花费药丸可打开面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:663","client.js:1461"]}
{"unit_id":"TSE2006__dsh-spend-meter#feature-3","repo":"TSE2006/dsh-spend-meter","commit":"1f48279facf4f387782b6d4416fe7a657eec8ea9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Spend Meter** 的功能「预算与近期趋势」：Spend Meter 汇总跨会话日账本，按配置的每日或每月预算显示进度，并提供近期花费趋势。 通过 composer dock 的花费药丸打开面板查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:823","client.js:1461"]}
